or-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"4a8a77b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c2b4095 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c2b4095\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a1c970c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a1c970c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1344\">Voltamos ainda mais capacitados e motivados para <strong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1249\">impulsionar a digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o do setor dos transportes e da log\u00edstica<\/strong>, ajudando as empresas a tornarem os seus processos mais eficientes, integrados e competitivos.<\/p><p data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1520\">Na Devlop, acreditamos que a <strong data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1436\">forma\u00e7\u00e3o cont\u00ednua e a proximidade com os nossos parceiros<\/strong> s\u00e3o essenciais para garantir solu\u00e7\u00f5es tecnol\u00f3gicas verdadeiramente transformadoras.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6b59d7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b6b59d7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{